  "location": "Doha, Qatar",
  "published": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "7d244581-bc01-493c-b42b-ad4437b0ee9a",
      "text": "The 12 hour flight went by surprisingly quickly. I landed in Doha at 5pm and got to my hotel by ~6pm. Hit Old Doha around 7:30pm. It was a gorgeous city with sandstone buildings fitted with warm accent lighting and a lot of outdoor seating. While the temperature hit a humid 100F during the day, by the evening it was in the high 80s, low 90s. It was so interesting seeing people dressed in the traditional clothing - full coverage Hijabs worn by women and Thawb robes & Ghutra headscarves worn by men.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
